@base = http://localhost:8888
@origin = http://localhost:5173
@userToken = 替换为用户登录返回的accessToken
@adminToken = 替换为管理员登录返回的accessToken
@categoryId = 1
@templateId = 1
@designId = 1

### 存活
GET {{base}}/healthz

### 就绪
GET {{base}}/readyz

### 注册测试用户（自行替换密码，不用于生产）
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"demo_user","password":"Replace-this-test-password"}

### 用户登录；客户端需保存 Set-Cookie
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"demo_user","password":"Replace-this-test-password"}

### 用户资料
GET {{base}}/api/v1/me
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 刷新（需携带登录返回的 design_user_refresh Cookie）
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Origin: {{origin}}

### 管理员登录，账号由 admin create 初始化
POST {{base}}/api/admin/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"你的管理员账号","password":"你的管理员密码"}

### 权限码
GET {{base}}/api/admin/v1/auth/codes
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 创建分类
POST {{base}}/api/admin/v1/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"海报","sort":10,"status":"active"}

### 创建模板；另见 template-create.example.json
POST {{base}}/api/admin/v1/templates
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"content":{"title":"自制示例海报","categoryId":"{{categoryId}}","tags":["示例"],"width":600,"height":800,"cover":"/api/v1/seed-assets/poster.svg","engine":"fabric","engineVersion":"6.0.0","schemaVersion":1,"document":{"objects":[{"type":"rect","width":600,"height":800,"fill":"#e7eef8"},{"type":"text","left":100,"top":300,"text":"DESIGN DEMO","fontFamily":"sans-serif","fontSize":40,"fill":"#3568d4"}]}}}

### 发布；version 替换为当前版本
POST {{base}}/api/admin/v1/templates/{{templateId}}/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":1}

### 公开搜索
GET {{base}}/api/v1/templates?keyword=示例&ratio=portrait&page=1&pageSize=20

### 管理端详情，查看草稿和发布快照
GET {{base}}/api/admin/v1/templates/{{templateId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 下架；刚发布后版本为 2
POST {{base}}/api/admin/v1/templates/{{templateId}}/offline
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":2}

### 退出；Cookie 或 Bearer 指定当前会话
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/logout
Origin: {{origin}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### B3 上传用户图片（将路径改为实际文件）
POST {{base}}/api/v1/assets
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=DesignUpload

--DesignUpload
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="kind"

image
--DesignUpload
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="poster.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./poster.png
--DesignUpload--

### B4 创建空白作品；新操作更换幂等键
POST {{base}}/api/v1/designs
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Idempotency-Key: blank-design-example-001
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"我的第一张海报","content":{"width":600,"height":800,"engine":"fabric","engineVersion":"6.7.1","schemaVersion":1,"document":{"version":"6.7.1","objects":[]}}}

### 作品详情：替换 designId
GET {{base}}/api/v1/designs/{{designId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 保存（使用最新版本）
PUT {{base}}/api/v1/designs/{{designId}}/document
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":1,"content":{"width":600,"height":800,"engine":"fabric","engineVersion":"6.7.1","schemaVersion":1,"document":{"objects":[{"type":"Textbox","text":"你好，设计","fontFamily":"sans-serif","fontSize":32}]}}}

### 回收站
GET {{base}}/api/v1/trash
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### B5 导出检查：version 替换为作品当前版本
POST {{base}}/api/v1/designs/{{designId}}/export-check
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":1,"format":"png","scale":1}

### B6 创建文件夹
POST {{base}}/api/v1/folders
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"公司海报"}

### B6 读取作品历史
GET {{base}}/api/v1/designs/{{designId}}/history
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### B8 保存禁用的图片服务配置（不会调用外部服务）
POST {{base}}/api/admin/v1/providers
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"待配置图片服务","kind":"image","endpoint":"https://your-provider.example/v1/images/generations","model":"待选择模型","status":"disabled"}

### B8 当前能力，未配置时 providers=[]
GET {{base}}/api/v1/job-capabilities
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
